{"id": "68446", "title": "邪少夺情：老婆，我宠你", "author": "姚瑶瑶", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 51, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68446.htm", "intro": "他占有她，却把她推给别人，她成了他恣意送人的布偶.“恨吗？”他曾在耳边阴佞地低问.“不！”她苍白的嘴唇勾起透明的笑，“不恨，恨人需要太多心力，所以我不恨你。因为你是鬼！你是魔鬼！你不是人！”(高干文)", "base": "files/article/html/68/68446", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "10529750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10529751.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10529752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10529753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-60", "file": "10529754.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-80", "file": "10529755.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-100", "file": "10529756.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-120", "file": "10529757.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-140", "file": "10529758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "141-160", "file": "10529759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "161-180", "file": "10529760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "181-200", "file": "10529761.html", "available": false}, {"title": "201-220", "file": "10529762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "221-240", "file": "10529763.html", "available": false}, {"title": "241-260", "file": "10529764.html", "available": false}, {"title": "261-280", "file": "10529765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "281-300", "file": "10529766.html", "available": false}, {"title": "301-320", "file": "10529767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "321-340", "file": "10529768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "241-260", "file": "10529769.html", "available": false}, {"title": "361-380", "file": "10529770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "381-400", "file": "10529771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "401-120", "file": "10529772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "421-440", "file": "10529773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "441-460", "file": "10529774.html", "available": f